            "text": "Children of the journey/product_discovery/checkout spans in SimulationManager.swift, passed as an explicit parentSpanID (not an ambient context stack \u2014 see the commit messages for why). discovery_fetch/product_view/cart_assembly have call sites in both the full random journey and the simplified fixed-path journey, since this app defaults to SIMPLIFIED_JOURNEY_ENABLED = YES. wishlist_add has no simplified-journey equivalent and stays sparse by design \u2014 that fixed path never visits Wishlist. See bd-shop-22 in workflows/.",
